OL,3,ABudget 2026: Key points at a glance
OL,4,
OL,5,FChancellor John Healey has set out the
OL,6,Fgovernment's tax and spending plans in
OL,7,Fhis Budget ` the first since Andy
OL,8,FBurnham became prime minister.
OL,10,FHere is a summary of the main points.
OL,12,FLIVE: Follow all the Budget coverage
OL,14,FOne-off #100 payment for 20 million
OL,15,Fhouseholds in council tax bands A-D in
OL,16,FEngland to help deal with rising energy
OL,17,Fbills, with equivalent funding for
OL,18,FScotland, Wales and Northern Ireland
